This skill's workflow (router + property-issue/tenancy-FAQ specialist
paths) is inspired by the publicly viewable behavior of
https://github.com/Kaos599/PropertyLoop
That source repository has no declared license (no LICENSE file at the time
of writing); no source code from it was copied — this skill is an
independent reimplementation of the observed agent architecture (router
logic, output schemas) as new prompts and reference documentation.
